### This is the bookmarks file for clifm ###

# Empty and commented lines are ignored.
# Make your changes, save, and exit.
# To remove a bookmark, delete the corresponding line, save, and exit
# Changes are applied automatically at exit (to cancel just quit the editor).

# The bookmarks syntax is: name:path
# Example:
clifm:/home/miro/.config/clifm/profiles/default
gallery:/home/miro/Pictures/gallery-dl
doc:/home/miro/Documents
yt:/home/miro/Videos/YouTube
